the parking garages.

86
00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:52.679
Mmm-mmm. No, no, no, no.

87
00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.957
You are not chickening out.
It's a good idea.

88
00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.589
I don't know. Sometimes when I go into
the big meetings,

89
