97
00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.632
'Cause that would be awful, right?

98
00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.235
- Josh!
- Everyone loving your great work.

99
00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.113
Possibly getting a pay raise,

100
