- Thank you.

129
00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.320
Oh, I'm cheesing really hard.

130
00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.436
- How are you...
- Oh!

131
00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.840
- Very sorry.
- Come on, man.

132
00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.680
So, it's not like I thought
I was gonna be

133
