slow-motion running sequence?

227
00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:42.593
Like, they're trying to break up
a wedding or get their lover back.

228
00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:43.716
Well, guess what?

229
00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.075
