Love...

1405
01:10:02.640 --> 01:10:04.233
it's crazy, right?

1406
01:10:15.080 --> 01:10:16.673
Well, I guess I don't really
have a choice, do I?

1407
01:10:20.920 --> 01:10:21.956
Whoo!

1408
01:10:22.040 --> 01:10:26.512
<i>As I drove away, I began
