1428
01:11:34.040 --> 01:11:35.030
Fuck!

1429
01:11:37.080 --> 01:11:38.070
Did you hear that?

1430
01:11:38.160 --> 01:11:39.150
Yeah.

1431
01:11:39.240 --> 01:11:41.038
Yes!

1432
01:11:43.960 --> 01:11:46.077
New York is a shithole again!

1433
